+// NATIVE23A2 (session 23): M3 EXECUTOR - SDK side. Included by d3d12/command_processor.cpp after native_frame_exec_verify.inc
+// (namespace rex::graphics::d3d12). Contract: claude_ipc/native23/M3_EXECUTOR_HANDOFF.md "Interface (M3.0)" + "REPLY 17:40"
+// (AGENT_NATIVE23B2: "writer runs + NOP-span").
+//
+// The game runs its PM4 writer as always and sends a v4 record with CALL_WORDS = the exact PM4 dwords of that writer call
+// (first packet .. DRAW packet). Two modes:
+//  * SHADOW (VERIFY_ONLY | MARKER_BEFORE): a 2-dword marker NOP {magic, id} sits directly BEFORE the call. At the marker the
+//    SDK peeks the next n stream dwords and compares them with call_words: equal = the record is the call, word for word.
+//    Per key (record VS address, PS address, vertex declaration) kM3ProveChecks exact shadows and 0 differences make the key
+//    OWNABLE (published through RexNativeRendererGetDrawMasksV2 flags; bit 1).
+//  * REPLACE (OWNED): the game overwrites the call's FIRST 3 dwords with a NOP spanning the call {magic, id, dwords 3..n-1}.
+//    At that NOP the SDK rebuilds the call = record call_words[0..2] + the NOP body read from the stream (the stream stays the
+//    truth for everything it still holds), checks body == call_words[3..] (per-draw verify), and the generic CP executes the
+//    rebuilt words in place of the NOP -> register file, shaders and draw == the emulated path BY CONSTRUCTION.
+//    This step moves no work yet; M3.5 replaces the execution of the rebuilt words by a cached draw entry for the CP win.
+//    Hole policy: a NOP span whose record is unknown cannot be rebuilt (3 dwords gone) -> counted as HOLE + logged. Records
+//    live until 8 swaps after their last execution (re-executed / tiled buffers reuse the id), unexecuted ones 16 swaps.
+//    The marker hook stays installed for the rest of the session once M3 was on, so switching off never strands an owned span.
+//
+// Switches (dist, polled every second): native_m3_shadow, native_m3_replace (shadow + accept OWNED for OWNABLE keys),
+// native_m3.off wins. Off: one relaxed load per submit; the CP pays nothing (the hook only runs for magic NOPs).
+// Log 'NATIVE M3 (10 s)'. Caps export RexNativeRendererM3CapsV1() = 3 (bit 0 shadow CALL_WORDS intake, bit 1 OWNED NOP span).
