+// every transferred rectangle; depth: z write with func ALWAYS + stencil ALWAYS with REPLACE/ZERO and write mask FF
+// (both faces); colour: all components written, blend ONE/ZERO/ADD, no alpha test, no alpha to coverage; and no other
