+// Records the passes. Expects color and depth in
+// D3D12_RESOURCE_STATE_NON_PIXEL_SHADER_RESOURCE (barriers already pushed).
+// On success the colour render target is left in
+// the state given back in color_state, depth unchanged; returns false (and
+// records nothing touching the colour target) when it could not run.
+// color_state receives the state the colour render target is left in:
+// D3D12_RESOURCE_STATE_UNORDERED_ACCESS (in-place final pass, render target
+// created with UAV access, see WantsUavRenderTargets) or
+// D3D12_RESOURCE_STATE_COPY_DEST (final pass into a copy, copied back).
+bool Apply(D3D12CommandProcessor& command_processor, const Target& target,
+           D3D12_RESOURCE_STATES& color_state);
