+// Asked when a render target is created: plain 8888 1x colour render targets
+// get D3D12_RESOURCE_FLAG_ALLOW_UNORDERED_ACCESS when true (decided once, at
+// the first call: switch file present and no "nouav" option), so the final
+// pass can work in place without a copy back. Off = render targets unchanged.
+bool WantsUavRenderTargets();
